    "detailed_description": "Introducing Syke, a first-person exploratory puzzle game set in a mesmerizing and enigmatic reality. Awakening in a world of impossible physics, you play as an individual making their way through areas of surreal complexity. Through a multitude of engaging puzzles and clues, you will work to piece together a story that defines the nature of this very world.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Four distinct and visually stunning areas to explore.<br><br></li><li>Experience mind-bending physics that give the world a unique flavor of gameplay.<br><br></li><li>Manipulate objects to discover important clues and discover the story of connection woven into the world.<br><br></li><li>Immerse yourself in a beautifully contemplative musical score.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Introducing Syke, a first-person exploratory puzzle game set in a mesmerizing and enigmatic reality. Awakening in a world of impossible physics, you play as an individual making their way through areas of surreal complexity. Through a multitude of engaging puzzles and clues, you will work to piece together a story that defines the nature of this very world.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Four distinct and visually stunning areas to explore.<br><br></li><li>Experience mind-bending physics that give the world a unique flavor of gameplay.<br><br></li><li>Manipulate objects to discover important clues and discover the story of connection woven into the world.<br><br></li><li>Immerse yourself in a beautifully contemplative musical score.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Syke is a first-person exploratory puzzle game set in a mysterious and beautifully warped reality. You play as an individual making their way through areas of strange geometry; solving puzzles to piece together the story of their love.",
